  "description": "Seo Yu-ju, the owner of Cafe Sallang, is kind to everyone except for the Taoists.\nDo Kang-hyun is a fourth-generation chaebol with a foul mouth but a good heart.\n\nKang-hyun, who went to retrieve a painting by an unknown artist at his grandfather's request, meets Yu-ju, who is determined not to let her grandmother's painting be taken away.\n\n\"Why do you dislike me?\"\n\nYu-ju's coldness causes Kang-hyun to change his plan to just buy the painting and return, and he seizes the opportunity to even move into her house.\n\n\"Hey, Do Kang-hyun. It's just a hand touch...\"\n\"A hand touch? You kneaded someone's body like dough, and you say it was just a hand touch?\"\n\"When did I ever knead dough—\"\n\"You did! Seo Yu-ju, have your fill with your own hands!\"\n\nLife under the same roof is anything but peaceful. It is a story about how a dog-cat relationship turns into a mutual one and only existence. Malice turns into interest, and ultimately, it leads to pure love.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/297089077), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69515019), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14343378), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000079070), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260452), [Mootoon](https://www.mootoon.co.kr/comic/moo_list.mg?tcode=r05v), [Qtoon](https://www.qtoon.co.kr/toon/list.mg?tcode=r32j), Toon365, ZzangComic, [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H049756657), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H049756657), [Aladin](https://www.aladin.co.kr/shop/wproduct.aspx?ItemId=396742741), [KyoboBook](https://ebook-product.kyobobook.co.kr/dig/epd/ebook/E000013165410), [Yes24](https://www.yes24.com/product/goods/192692630)",
